This is a pre-announcement for the Linux Security Summit 2011, to help 
people plan budgets & travel.

Following the success of last year's event [1], the program committee has 
begun planning a similar event for 2011, to be co-located with the Linux 
Plumbers Conference (LPC) [2].

The Linux Security Summit this year will be held on the 8th of September 
in Santa Rosa, CA, USA.

A full announcement and CFP will be made at a later date.



[1] https://security.wiki.kernel.org/index.php/LinuxSecuritySummit2010
[2] https://lkml.org/lkml/2011/1/17/187


